{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Sea Trip</strong> is 2D RPG deep water adventure game.  The Oceans have many dangers,  but there are new dangers that threaten all deep sea and ocean life.\u00a0 You are The Fish and must save the day by helping ocean friends, defeating toxic and trash monsters while figuring out their way through the ocean and life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Winner of the Best Innovation Award at 2DCon 2025!</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096450/extras/c0d1bdf3bcddf8b8aea975c2a6add715.avif?t=1760469806\" width=372 height=330 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo showcases one of the five main towns, featuring its NPC quests and dungeon.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several of the many variety/types of corals to grow</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is still in Early Development, you may encounter unfinished/unpolished mechanics </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic roleplaying elements mixed with modern themes </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of enemies to defeat with various battle styles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096450/extras/cceec5839166bd096fbb6afaa06ea8c4.poster.avif?t=1760469806\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096450/extras/cceec5839166bd096fbb6afaa06ea8c4.webm?t=1760469806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buildings and caves to explore</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096450/extras/9e6a15c7e153fcd5a18e0fcc2b248782.poster.avif?t=1760469806\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096450/extras/9e6a15c7e153fcd5a18e0fcc2b248782.webm?t=1760469806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various NPC's to interact in different ways with</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096450/extras/067bfd0da1d76d1d112bcdcf633761eb.poster.avif?t=1760469806\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096450/extras/067bfd0da1d76d1d112bcdcf633761eb.webm?t=1760469806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Bubble Wands for a variety of things</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096450/extras/fae9d159bb77340a2426788e6d275100.poster.avif?t=1760469806\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"ht